  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WebLinkForGrievanceRedressPolicy' (WebLinkForGrievanceRedressPolicy) is 'Vigil Mechanism and Whistle-Blower Policy is available on the RIL website. Purchase Order/Contract provides a dispute resolution mechanism, which stipulates meetings between higher management teams of both sides to resolve disputes. Additionally, grievance redressal and customer feedback policy is in place for value chain partners, with dedicated leads overseeing the process and regular feedback and resolution sessions conducted. Further, for E&P JV partners, monthly and quarterly meetings are held.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WebLinkForGrievanceRedressPolicy, Context: D_ComplaintReceivedFromValueChainPartners)"
