  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MechanismsToPreventAdverseConsequencesToTheComplainantInDiscriminationAndHarassmentCasesExplanatoryTextBlock' (MechanismsToPreventAdverseConsequencesToTheComplainantInDiscriminationAndHarassmentCasesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Reliance has a ‘Vigil Mechanism and Whistleblower Policy’ and Prevention of Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace Policy to prevent any adverse consequences to the complainant. Identity of the whistleblower is protected and retaliation/intimidation directed against the whistleblower is prohibited. Employees who engage in retaliation or intimidation are subject to disciplinary action, which may include dismissal from employment.\n\nThe Company has also constituted Internal Committee(s) (\"ICs\") to redress and resolve any complaints arising under the POSH Act. Training and awareness sessions are conducted throughout the year to enhance sensitivity at the workplace.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MechanismsToPreventAdverseConsequencesToTheComplainantInDiscriminationAndHarassmentCasesExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
