  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSignificantRisksOrConcernsArisingFromTheAssessmentsOfPlantAndOfficeExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSignificantRisksOrConcernsArisingFromTheAssessmentsOfPlantAndOfficeExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'No significant findings noted.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSignificantRisksOrConcernsArisingFromTheAssessmentsOfPlantAndOfficeExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfABusinessProcessBeingModifiedOrIntroducedAsAResultOfAddressingHumanRightsGrievancesOrComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfABusinessProcessBeingModifiedOrIntroducedAsAResultOfAddressingHumanRightsGrievancesOrComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'While no specific complaints have been received, the Company remains committed to addressing human rights concerns. This commitment is reflected in mandatory training programmes such as the Code of Conduct and Creating a Respectful Workplace, reinforcing a culture of ethical conduct and inclusivity. Any modification or introduction of business processes, policies, or practices undergoes scrutiny through the lens of the Company’s Code of Conduct and Values & Behaviours.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfABusinessProcessBeingModifiedOrIntroducedAsAResultOfAddressingHumanRightsGrievancesOrComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Human Rights considerations have been deeply embedded in Reliance’s values and operations since its inception. The Company remains committed to upholding these principles and continues to ensure full compliance with all relevant statutory requirements.'.",
