  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'AnyIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceHasBeenCarriedOutByAnExternalAgencyForEnergyConsumption' (AnyIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceHasBeenCarriedOutByAnExternalAgencyForEnergyConsumption) is 'true'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: AnyIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceHasBeenCarriedOutByAnExternalAgencyForEnergyConsumption, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NameOfTheExternalAgencyIfAnyIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceHasBeenCarriedOutByAnExternalAgencyForEnergyConsumptionExplanatoryTextBlock' (NameOfTheExternalAgencyIfAnyIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceHasBeenCarriedOutByAnExternalAgencyForEnergyConsumptionExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Deloitte Haskins & Sells LLP has carried out an independent assurance of the selected non-financial disclosures presented in the Business Responsibility and Sustainability Report (BRSR) for FY 2025-26. For complete assurance statement, refer to page 92 of the BRSR pdf.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: NameOfTheExternalAgencyIfAnyIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceHasBeenCarriedOutByAnExternalAgencyForEnergyConsumptionExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveAnySitesOrFacilitiesIdentifiedAsDesignatedConsumersUnderThePerformanceAchieveAndTradeSchemeOfTheGovernmentOfIndia' (DoesTheEntityHaveAnySitesOrFacilitiesIdentifiedAsDesignatedConsumersUnderThePerformanceAchieveAndTradeSchemeOfTheGovernmentOfIndia) is 'true'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityHaveAnySitesOrFacilitiesIdentifiedAsDesignatedConsumersUnderThePerformanceAchieveAndTradeSchemeOfTheGovernmentOfIndia, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DiscloseWhetherTargetsSetUnderThePatSchemeHaveBeenAchievedInCaseTargetsHaveNotBeenAchievedThenProvideTheRemedialActionTakenExplanatoryTextBlock' (DiscloseWhetherTargetsSetUnderThePatSchemeHaveBeenAchievedInCaseTargetsHaveNotBeenAchievedThenProvideTheRemedialActionTakenExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Multiple Oil to Chemicals (O2C) business sites in the Refinery, Petrochemical (Cracker based), Chlor Alkali and Textile sector have been declared as Designated Consumers (DCs), under the PAT scheme of Government of India. The sector-wise status is as below:\n\n1. Refinery Sector - DTA and SEZ, Jamnagar Manufacturing Division -For the Refinery's second PAT cycle (2020-2023), the verification of audited number of ESCerts is awaited from BEE (Bureau of Energy Efficiency) for DTA (Domestic Tariff Area). The SEZ (Special Economic Zone) refinery achieved its target.\n\n2. Petrochemical Sector (Cracker based) - Hazira / Dahej / Vadodara / Nagothane Manufacturing Division - For Petrochemicals' last concluded PAT cycle (2018-2022), the verification of audited number of ESCerts is awaited from BEE.\n\n3. Chlor Alkali Sector (Dahej Manufacturing Division) and Textile Sector (Naroda Textile Division) - For the recently concluded PAT cycle (2022-2025), Monitoring and Verification (M&V) audit has been concluded. The verification of audited number of ESCerts is awaited from BEE.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DiscloseWhetherTargetsSetUnderThePatSchemeHaveBeenAchievedInCaseTargetsHaveNotBeenAchievedThenProvideTheRemedialActionTakenExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
