  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'The minimisation of any negative impacts on sensitive areas is ensured through compliance to all prescribed conditions and regular monitoring.'.",
