  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PublicPolicyAdvocated' (PublicPolicyAdvocated) is 'Advocacy efforts are undertaken within a structured governance framework, guided by the Code of Conduct, and reflect a balanced consideration of business objectives, regulatory expectations, and broader public interest. The Company focuses on building and sustaining long-term, mutually beneficial relationships with government authorities, regulators, trade unions, investors, suppliers, and local communities, thereby enabling effective governance, regulatory compliance, and the enhancement of social and environmental outcomes. The Company's approach is firmly anchored in its Code of Conduct, which mandates the highest standards of ethical business practices, including strict adherence to anti-bribery and anti-corruption principles. As a responsible corporate citizen, RIL recognises its role in engaging in policy advocacy that delivers positive and sustainable societal impact, while remaining fully aligned with lawful, transparent, and ethical conduct.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PublicPolicyAdvocated, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy' (MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy) is 'Active membership in leading industry associations to collaborate on matters impacting the industry. Such engagements are aimed at promoting, protecting, and enhancing both the nation's and the Company's interests. All interactions with regulatory and external authorities are undertaken with due consideration to organizational priorities as well as the broader national interest, ensuring responsible representation, policy alignment, and constructive industry advocacy.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WhetherInformationAvailableInPublicDomain' (WhetherInformationAvailableInPublicDomain) is 'false'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WhetherInformationAvailableInPublicDomain, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FrequencyOfReviewByBoard' (FrequencyOfReviewByBoard) is 'Others – please specify'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FrequencyOfReviewByBoard, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WebLinkPublicPolicyPositionAdvocated' (WebLinkPublicPolicyPositionAdvocated) is 'NA'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WebLinkPublicPolicyPositionAdvocated, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheMechanismsToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesOfTheCommunityExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheMechanismsToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesOfTheCommunityExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'RIL has both formal and informal channels in place for engaging with local communities. At all manufacturing sites, Corporate Affairs Department personnel regularly engage with community members and ensure that the Company's business operations are carried out keeping in view the needs of the communities and the larger objective of community welfare.\n\nCommunication can also be shared via verbal channels, e-mails, telephonic conversations and meetings, after which appropriate action is taken.\n\nAdditionally, RIL's vendor partners are facilitated through a grievance redressal mechanism via the SevaFirst Portal, wherein they may raise issues related to various supply chain domains, including payments and vendor configuration.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DescribeTheMechanismsToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesOfTheCommunityExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfDirectlySourcedFromMSMEsOrSmallProducers' (PercentageOfDirectlySourcedFromMSMEsOrSmallProducers) is '0.1354' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfDirectlySourcedFromMSMEsOrSmallProducers, Context: DCYMain)"
