  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FromWhichMarginalizedOrVulnerableGroupsDoYouProcure' (FromWhichMarginalizedOrVulnerableGroupsDoYouProcure) is 'Reliance engages with suppliers and contractors located in the same geography (100-km radius of its plants) to support the local economy. In the FY 2025-26, total of 5,077 suppliers from the nearby geography (i.e. 100-km radius) delivered goods and services worth ₹18,518 Crore to RIL sites.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FromWhichMarginalizedOrVulnerableGroupsDoYouProcure, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WhatPercentageOfTotalProcurementByValueDoesItConstitute' (WhatPercentageOfTotalProcurementByValueDoesItConstitute) is '0.0377' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WhatPercentageOfTotalProcurementByValueDoesItConstitute, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheMechanismsInPlaceToReceiveAndRespondToConsumerComplaintsAndFeedbackExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheMechanismsInPlaceToReceiveAndRespondToConsumerComplaintsAndFeedbackExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'The customer complaints can be received through e-mails, phone calls, meetings, surveys and web portals. The regional sales account managers handle customer complaints. In case of any complaint, the customer intimates the service provider (RIL) of the issue. Thereafter, the relevant department resolves the customer issue, and the marketing group ensures appropriate closure of the complaints. The regional sales team registers the customer complaint on the portal. The image in the BRSR pdf depicts the macro level general process flow diagram.\n\nAdditionally, for Exploration and Production, a consumer satisfaction survey was conducted. An online customer feedback process is also developed.\n\nFor the Bioenergy business, a complaint registration system is available at site, managed by the security team, while the concerned department ensures timely resolution of complaints.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DescribeTheMechanismsInPlaceToReceiveAndRespondToConsumerComplaintsAndFeedbackExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
