  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveAFrameworkOrPolicyOnCyberSecurityAndRisksRelatedToDataPrivacy' (DoesTheEntityHaveAFrameworkOrPolicyOnCyberSecurityAndRisksRelatedToDataPrivacy) is 'Yes'.",
