  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WebLinkOfThePolicyOnCyberSecurityAndRisksRelatedToDataPrivacy' (WebLinkOfThePolicyOnCyberSecurityAndRisksRelatedToDataPrivacy) is 'A comprehensive cybersecurity framework aligned with leading industry standards such as NIST CSF and ISO 27001 is leveraged. The data privacy policy is hosted at https://www.ril.com/privacy-policy.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WebLinkOfThePolicyOnCyberSecurityAndRisksRelatedToDataPrivacy, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayOnIssuesRelatingToAdvertisingAndDeliveryOfEssentialServicesOrCyberSecurityAndDataPrivacyOrRecallsOrPenaltyOrActionTakenByRegulatoryAuthoritiesOnSafetyOfProductsOrServicesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayOnIssuesRelatingToAdvertisingAndDeliveryOfEssentialServicesOrCyberSecurityAndDataPrivacyOrRecallsOrPenaltyOrActionTakenByRegulatoryAuthoritiesOnSafetyOfProductsOrServicesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'NA'.",
